---
subject: Auto-enrollment disabled for <%= it.organizationName %>
preheader: The DNS proof for <%= it.domain %> is no longer valid.
---
<div style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#dc2626;">Domain verification</div><h1 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#18181b;">Auto-enrollment has been disabled</h1><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525b;">The DNS TXT record that proves ownership of <strong style="color:#18181b;"><%= it.domain %></strong> is missing or no longer matches. <strong style="color:#18181b;"><%= it.organizationName %></strong> no longer automatically receives new members whose email uses this domain.</p><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525b;">Ask a platform administrator to restart the domain verification from the organization settings. Existing members are not removed by this change.</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#71717a;">If this was intentional, no action is required.</p>
===TEXT===
Auto-enrollment has been disabled for <%= it.organizationName %>.

The DNS TXT record that proves ownership of <%= it.domain %> is missing or no longer matches. New accounts with this email domain will no longer join the organization automatically.

Ask a platform administrator to restart the domain verification from the organization settings. Existing members are not removed.

If this was intentional, no action is required.
